{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And his eyes dimmed.</b> And not Rebecca's eyes — because woman was created from bone, and Esau's wives are from bone, and bone does not harm bone; but they can harm a man — that is, Isaac, whose beginning is from the earth. Another interpretation: <b>his eyes</b> and not Rebecca's eyes — because she was accustomed in her father's house to the smoke of idolatry."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:09.003184391Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}